{"1390080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tank Rampage", "steam_appid": 1390080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/a7e219d2db55c76af5ecab66c04e39c7.poster.avif?t=1621685933\" width=636 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/a7e219d2db55c76af5ecab66c04e39c7.webm?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/a7e219d2db55c76af5ecab66c04e39c7.mp4?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tank Rampage is a team-based multiplayer PvP action game.<br>Your main goal is to capture this coveted city, but another team will interfere with you, which also wants to have power over it.<br><br><strong>COMBAT ACTIONS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/1ba732ff105febd6b20f2b2d70d2776b.poster.avif?t=1621685933\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/1ba732ff105febd6b20f2b2d70d2776b.webm?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/1ba732ff105febd6b20f2b2d70d2776b.mp4?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dominate the city with the <i>fog of war</i> - you can tactically inflict significant damage to the enemy from where he cannot expect.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/d0393d15d8c876df396a1a6fd7a92392.poster.avif?t=1621685933\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/d0393d15d8c876df396a1a6fd7a92392.webm?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/d0393d15d8c876df396a1a6fd7a92392.mp4?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CAPTURE ZONES</strong><br>To take over the city faster, you must capture <i>the police station</i> or the building of the local <i>television</i>, in order to master the propaganda.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/ffc89a41cd8b3ea4affe7a87e654d9ff.poster.avif?t=1621685933\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/ffc89a41cd8b3ea4affe7a87e654d9ff.webm?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/ffc89a41cd8b3ea4affe7a87e654d9ff.mp4?t=1621685933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>up to 4 players online</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>quick and juicy battles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>destroy opponents with a cannon or machine gun</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>several playable multiplayer arenas</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>great visual effects</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/a7e219d2db55c76af5ecab66c04e39c7.poster.avif?t=1621685933\" width=636 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390080/extras/a7e219d2db55c76af5ecab66c04e39c7.webm?t=16216859